Id: perm001a
Severity: ALERT
Category: filesystem
Check: check_perms
Fix: chown the file as the database says, and check for intrusion.
References: chown(1)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The owner of the indicated file is not correct.  This is a serious security
problem and may indicate that an intrusion has occurred.  The system should
be checked and cleaned.  The owner of the file should be corrected.
